# Sample LSP Initialize Request

File: lsp/examples/initialize_request.oot

## Request

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "processId": 12345,
    "rootUri": "file:///home/user/project",
    "capabilities": {}
  }
}
```

## Expected response (shape)

`result.capabilities` matches `capabilities.oot`.
`result.serverInfo.name` is `openooda-lsp`.
`result.serverInfo.version` is `lsp_facade_version()`.
`completionProvider.resolveProvider` is true. `workspace.workspaceFolders` is supported.
